<title>SPAIN: BBV raises stake in Telefonica to 5 pct.</title>
<headline>BBV raises stake in Telefonica to 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's BBV increased its stake in Telefonica de Espana SA to five percent from four percent, a statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>BBV is not ruling out the possibility of further increasing the stake if market conditions are be favorable.</p>
<p>The government plans to sell its remaining 21 percent stake in Telefonica in the first months of 1997.</p>
<p>BBV, Caixa and Argentaria together have around 15 percent in Telefonica. Telefonica shares today fall 0.83 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
